        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 334-SQT, Square Passage Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Square Pocket Door Passage Set neither latches or locks. This Square Tubular Passage Pocket Door Hardware features a 2-in-1 tubular latch with pop-out edge pull. The Pop Out Edge Pull is spring loaded and can be ejected from the door's edge with the press of a finger. This sliding door set will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch backsets. The Square Passage Pocket Door Hardware is available in a wide array of finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features a pop out edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket as well as a strike with raised detail to auto-retract the edge pull when closing the door.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/square-pocket-door-privacy-set-kwikset-335-sqt\"><b>Square Privacy Set for Pocket Doors</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Passage Square Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Length: 2.44\" square</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8''</li>\r\n<li>Edge Bore: 1''</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a pop-out edge pull, a strike, dust box, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
